Package: tyt-reader
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.10), python3-tk, systemd, udev
Description: Desktop codeplug editor for TYT MD-UV380 and MD-UV390 radios
 Read channels, contacts, zones, RX groups and scan lists over USB or from
 codeplug files. Review settings changes, keep a local backup and verify
 programmed sectors by reading them back.
